  "adaptation": {
    "semantic": "Many languages use different words for correct (sense 1), suitable (sense 2), morally good (sense 3), and the side of the body (sense 4). Translate each sense with its own word.",
    "grammar": "A person **is** right: *you are right*. Many languages use a verb meaning **have** here; English does not.",
